WEBVTT

00:03:28.076 --> 00:03:30.796
but I could not produce his name.

00:03:30.836 --> 00:03:33.196
I eventually gave up and googled it.

00:03:33.236 --> 00:03:35.716
"Actor who played Tony Soprano."

00:03:35.756 --> 00:03:37.356
James Gandolfini.

00:03:37.396 --> 00:03:38.956
Yes, that's it.

00:03:39.636 --> 00:03:43.356
Blocking on a word,
also called tip of the tongue,

00:03:43.396 --> 00:03:47.036
is one of the most common
experiences of memory failure.

00:03:47.076 --> 00:03:51.236
You're trying to come up with a word,
most often a proper noun,

00:03:51.276 --> 00:03:54.836
but you cannot, for the life of you,
retrieve it on demand.

00:03:55.156 --> 00:03:56.996
Why does this happen?

00:03:57.356 --> 00:04:00.476
Blocking on a word can occur
when there's only partial